    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled in the peaceful countryside of Rathmore, Kilkerley, this charming cottage offers a wonderful opportunity to enjoy rural living while remaining within easy reach of Dundalk and the M1 motorway. Set on a mature site with attractive surroundings, the property combines character, comfort, and privacy in a highly desirable location.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright and welcoming throughout, featuring well-proportioned living spaces, comfortable bedroom, and a practical layout suitable for a range of buyers, including first-time purchasers, downsizers, and those seeking a tranquil country retreat. The property enjoys generous outdoor space with gardens providing excellent potential for relaxation, gardening, or future enhancement.\r\n\r\nLocated just minutes from local schools, community amenities, and transport links, The Cottage benefits from the best of both worlds – a peaceful rural setting with convenient access to Dundalk, Dublin, and Belfast.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nHallway - 1.12m x 2.06m \r\nLiving Room - 3.42m x 4.34m \r\nKitchen - 3.12m x 4.24m \r\nLanding - 1.09m x 2.06m \r\nBedroom 1 - 2.04m x 3.53m \r\nOffice - 4.23m x 3.01m \r\nBathroom - 2.05m x 2.04m \r\nShower Room - 2.05m x 2.04m\r\n\r\nBlue Sky Property and their servants or agents assume no responsibility for and give no guarantees, undertakings or warranties concerning the accuracy, completeness or up to date nature of the information and do not accept any liability whatsoever arising from any errors or omissions. The information does not constitute or form part of a contract and cannot be relied on as a representation of fact. Subject to contract / contract denied. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate, and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
